@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
hide empty members
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title Repository · Guardar las tareas observadas

class ImportarTareasObservadas #F0FDF4 {
  +execute(accountId, assignments)
}
interface AssignmentImportRepository #F0FDF4 {
  +recordImport(accountId, assignments)
  +latestCompletedSearchId(accountId)
}
class PostgresAssignmentImportRepository #FFF7ED {
  +recordImport(accountId, assignments)
  +latestCompletedSearchId(accountId)
}
class "PostgreSQL\ntasks · jobs" as db <<database>>

ImportarTareasObservadas ..> AssignmentImportRepository : usa el puerto
AssignmentImportRepository <|.. PostgresAssignmentImportRepository
PostgresAssignmentImportRepository --> db : guarda en una transacción
note right of PostgresAssignmentImportRepository
  Upsert por cuenta e identificador externo.
  Una actividad conserva el mismo registro.
end note
@enduml
